  "authorization": "User requested VFOPT-UI-027 and continued its implementation and required checks, then asked for the next work item.",
  "changes": [
    "Add weak geometry caches and conservative PCB viewport bounds for footprints, traces, ratlines and vias, including rotated pads, text overhang, stroke/shadow and crossing-line visibility.",
    "Use 64-screen-pixel entry overscan and a 256-pixel removal margin to reuse boundary objects during reversed pan/zoom; retain current selection, active routing source and active native drag targets.",
    "Memoize shape components, stabilize action callbacks and reuse unchanged React elements. Separate toolbar subscriptions and retain the full-layout DRC/export bridge.",
    "Track native Stage panning through one cancellable RAF and commit the document viewport only at release. Keep child drag events from moving the viewport.",
    "Cache visible footprints and short static copper with a shared 32 MiB retained RGBA budget and 256 KiB per-object limit; use local trace coordinates, release caches on invalidation/unmount and fall back to vectors for oversized objects.",
    "Reduce labels, orientation dots and tiny drill drawings below scale 0.7 while preserving pad hit targets and all stored physical geometry.",
    "Make front copper visibility independent of front silkscreen visibility, and retain current routing/read-only semantics across memoized callbacks."
  ],
